WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.850
Each figure adds the same amount, and that gives the rule.

2
00:00:04.503 --> 00:00:07.628
Figure one is one square, made of four sticks.

3
00:00:08.379 --> 00:00:12.979
Figure two adds a square, but it shares a side, so only three new sticks.

4
00:00:15.489 --> 00:00:18.389
Every new square adds three more sticks.

5
00:00:21.862 --> 00:00:26.937
Figure n has n lots of three, plus one: s equals three n plus one.

6
00:00:27.591 --> 00:00:31.516
Figure four is three times four, plus one, which is thirteen.
